# The LF-only gate (`line-endings`) and every suite that mutates a source file
# by exact LF text require these to be LF in the working tree. The machine's
# global `core.autocrlf=true` rewrote lane patches to CRLF (measured 2026-11-24:
# the gate refused `twitch-adblock.js` and `content.js`), so the dialect is
# pinned here instead of being re-normalized by hand after every merge.
kick-overlay/*.js text eol=lf
kick-overlay/*.cjs text eol=lf
kick-overlay/*.json text eol=lf
kick-overlay/*.html text eol=lf
kick-overlay/*.css text eol=lf
_tools/*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
